'''Relic Bun-Bun''' (真レジェンドブンブン, ''Shin Rejendo Bun-Bun'', '''True Legend Bun-Bun''') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] variant of [[Mecha-Bun (Enemy)|Mecha-Bun]] introduced in the first stage of [[Uncanny Legends]], [[An Ancient Curse]]. It is the enemy version of [[Mecha-Bun (Special Cat)|Ultimate Mecha-Bun]]. It was added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]].

